<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Reset Your Password</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; }
    .header { background: #ef4444; color: white; padding: 30px; text-align: center; border-radius: 8px 8px 0 0; }
    .content { background: #f9fafb; padding: 30px; border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px; }
    .button { display: inline-block; background: #ef4444; color: white; padding: 12px 24px; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; margin: 20px 0; }
    .footer { text-align: center; padding: 20px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; }
    .warning { background: #fef3c7; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px; margin: 20px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="header">
    <h1>Reset Your Password</h1>
  </div>
  <div class="content">
    <p>Hi <%= @user.name || @user.email %>,</p>
    
    <p>We received a request to reset your MyStandMap password.</p>
    
    <p>
      <%= link_to "Reset Password", edit_password_reset_url(reset_token: @reset_token), class: "button" %>
    </p>
    
    <div class="warning">
      <strong>Important:</strong> This link will expire in <%= @expire_hours %> hours for security reasons.
    </div>
    
    <p>If you didn't request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email. Your password will remain unchanged.</p>
    
    <p>- The MyStandMap Team</p>
  </div>
  <div class="footer">
    <p>© <%= Date.current.year %> MyStandMap - Connecting Wisconsin with Local Food</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
